/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1910,"digest":"sha256:723475cfff067cb112afd06b48175aaeb0c57fb869c19f63b243da7dce74a969","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:32:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T07:32:28Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.60.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.60.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.60.0","body":"# v0.60.0 — Studio and Replay supporting-screen readability\n\nThis package records the reviewed P05 supporting-screen readability source scope below. Its actual qualification and original frozen payload evidence are attached. Affected player journeys and phase acceptance require separate public verification; this package does not claim completion of the music rollout, physical-device certification or later phases.\n\nReviewed P05 source scope: studio readability, font previews, inventory focus, replay display preferences, persisted return.\n\nExact game source: `170508f11dd41204b7e24917a823f21701c15961` (tree `287ea0fddf97f594af0ce9eba452a24dc5f507c7`).\n\nAll six source gates passed through the hosted exact-source workflow. Each of the two complete four-shard families passed 5,399 tests with zero failures, cancellations, skips or TODOs. Production reproduction/readiness and the ordinary build passed on the hosted source. Both hosted source families used Node 20.19.6. No local command gates are claimed by this qualification pipeline; earlier local P05 cohorts remain separately source-scoped corroboration. The full test suite and ordinary build use the actual hosted authority above; no duplicate local execution is claimed.\n\nThe separately authenticated hosted utility inspected the complete frozen original artifact. Its source archive matches all 8,303 tracked files and modes. Every one of the 679 game files matches its original manifest. Local assembly rehashes the retained original metadata and preserves exact runner member descriptors for the source and distribution payloads; it does not download or rehash the large originals locally. The attached evidence preserves the selected original qualification and supporting-screen observations, including retained earlier failures; it does not replace verification of this release after deployment.\n\nPredecessor: [v0.59.1](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.59.1). Retain immutable v0.59.1 source/tag/all nine original release assets. Archive15 commit506a6cb97d0c5987532771520bfa30795b6fe28d retains original v0.57.1 andv0.59.1 bytes. Complete1343-file publicaudit and root actual keyboard play/results/bridge observations pass. Next publication must preserve every existingcatalogentry and all prior archivepins, admit this successor with originals, route v0.59.1 to archive15 only after validated publisher; retain public predecessor/rollback. New v0.60.0 public acceptance remains separate. Complete the normal main publisher PR/merge, deployed byte verification and applicable native play/offline evidence. Source and attachment qualification alone do not establish public P05 acceptance.\n\nAt package assembly, public byte/play/offline verification is pending; acceptance is recorded separately after publication. Full P05 remains incomplete. Modeled input, browser observations and physical-device qualification remain separate evidence categories.\n"}